==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-us-deal with.ogg|a=US}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|<,,dealt>|head=~deal[:#Verb]}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To handle verbally or in some form of artistic expression; to [[address]] or [[discuss]] as a [[subject]].
#: {{syn|en|address|cover|handle|plough|treat|regard|q5=especially in art or literature}}
#: {{ux|en|This book '''deals with''' incest.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To take action with [[respect]] to (someone or something).
#: {{syn|en|engage|handle|take on|work}}
#: {{ux|en|The treasurer '''deals with''' financial matters.}}
#: {{ux|en|The teacher knew how to '''deal with''' these lazy students.}}
#* {{RQ:Economist|date=2013-08-10|volume=408|issue=8848
|title=[http://www.economist.com/news/leaders/21583277-worlds-biggest-polluter-going-green-it-needs-speed-up-transition-can-china Can China clean up fast enough?]
|passage=It is therefore '''dealing with''' pollution in two ways—suppression and mitigation.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To consider, as an example.
#: {{syn|en|consider|look at|take}}
#: {{ux|en|Let us '''deal with''' the case of China.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To confront or overcome any difficulties presented by.
#: {{syn|en|come to terms with|contend with|cope with|get by with|grapple with|make do with|make out with|manage with}}
#: {{ux|en|We had to '''deal with''' having just a gallon of gas.}}
#: {{ux|en|She's '''dealing with''' a lot of personal problems right now.}}
#: {{ux|en|Thankfully he'd '''dealt with''' such issues before, so he had all the necessary experience.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To be in charge of, act on, or dispose of.
#: {{syn|en|care for|handle|look after|manage|take care of}}
#: {{ux|en|I can '''deal with''' this crew of workers.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To behave in a certain way towards.
#: {{syn|en|interact with}}
#: {{ux|en|He '''deals''' fairly '''with''' his employees.}}
#* {{RQ:King James Version|Ezekiel|23|25|passage=And I will set my ielousie against thee, and they shall '''deale''' furiously '''with''' thee: they shall take away thy nose and thine eares, and thy remnant shall fall by the sword: they shall take thy sonnes and thy daughters, and thy residue shal be deuoured by the fire.}}

